{"id":"9cc3cffe81d4e71b","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-thm-thom.md","title":"Thom's First Isotopy Lemma","display":"thm-thom — Thom's First Isotopy Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-thom","aliases":["58-thm-thom"],"display":"thm-thom — Thom's First Isotopy Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top4-proper-map.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-stratification.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-atlas.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-thom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-thom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-thom — Thom's First Isotopy Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ffb0a0f4e68507b\" href=\"?note=9ffb0a0f4e68507b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top4-proper-map.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top4-proper-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c86c862e709fb95d\" href=\"?note=c86c862e709fb95d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-stratification.md\">../batch10/58-df-stratification.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d530952583f9f96d\" href=\"?note=d530952583f9f96d\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md\">../batch05/58-df-atlas.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"58-df-homeomorphism.md\">58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,I,\\mathcal S,f,m,\\mathcal A_Y,d,\\mathcal A_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,I,\\mathcal S,f,m,\\mathcal A_Y,d,\\mathcal A_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_\\alpha=\\mathcal S(\\alpha)\">\\(S_\\alpha=\\mathcal S(\\alpha)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WhitneyStratification}_S,\\operatorname{Atlas}_S,\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop4ProperMap}_S,\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WhitneyStratification}_S,\\operatorname{Atlas}_S,\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop4ProperMap}_S,\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are the predicates from the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldData}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StratumSubmersionData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StratumSubmersionData}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StratifiedLocallyTrivial}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StratifiedLocallyTrivial}_S\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldData}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_Y,m)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nm\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\n\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\operatorname{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A_Y,Y,\\tau_Y,m)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall y_0,y_1\\in Y\\;(y_0\\neq y_1\\to\n\\exists U,V\\in\\tau_Y\\;(y_0\\in U\\land y_1\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau_Y\\;\n\\bigl(|\\mathcal B|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\tau_Y\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(y\\in B\\subseteq U)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle,\\langle V,Q,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_Y\\;\n\\bigl(U\\cap V\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap V]\\in C^\\infty\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldData}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_Y,m)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nm\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\n\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\operatorname{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A_Y,Y,\\tau_Y,m)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall y_0,y_1\\in Y\\;(y_0\\neq y_1\\to\n\\exists U,V\\in\\tau_Y\\;(y_0\\in U\\land y_1\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau_Y\\;\n\\bigl(|\\mathcal B|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\tau_Y\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(y\\in B\\subseteq U)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\langle U,O,\\phi\\rangle,\\langle V,Q,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_Y\\;\n\\bigl(U\\cap V\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap V]\\in C^\\infty\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{StratumSubmersionData}_S\n(f,S,\\tau_S,\\mathcal A_S,r,Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_Y,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A_S,S,\\tau_S,r)\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldData}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_Y,m)\n\\land f\\upharpoonright S\\in Y^S\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in S\\;\n\\left[\nd(f\\upharpoonright S)_p:T_p^{\\mathcal A_S}S\\to T_{f(p)}^{\\mathcal A_Y}Y\n\\land\\forall w\\in T_{f(p)}^{\\mathcal A_Y}Y\\;\\exists v\\in T_p^{\\mathcal A_S}S\\;\n\\bigl(d(f\\upharpoonright S)_p(v)=w\\bigr)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{StratumSubmersionData}_S\n(f,S,\\tau_S,\\mathcal A_S,r,Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_Y,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A_S,S,\\tau_S,r)\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldData}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_Y,m)\n\\land f\\upharpoonright S\\in Y^S\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in S\\;\n\\left[\nd(f\\upharpoonright S)_p:T_p^{\\mathcal A_S}S\\to T_{f(p)}^{\\mathcal A_Y}Y\n\\land\\forall w\\in T_{f(p)}^{\\mathcal A_Y}Y\\;\\exists v\\in T_p^{\\mathcal A_S}S\\;\n\\bigl(d(f\\upharpoonright S)_p(v)=w\\bigr)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{StratifiedLocallyTrivial}_S(f,\\mathcal S,I,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_Y\\;\\exists F,\\tau_F,\\tau_{U\\times F},h\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\ny\\in U\n\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(F,\\tau_F)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\tau_{U\\times F}\n=\\{W\\subseteq U\\times F:\\forall\\langle u,z\\rangle\\in W\\;\n\\exists O\\in\\tau_Y\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_F\\;\n(u\\in O\\cap U\\land z\\in V\\land(O\\cap U)\\times V\\subseteq W)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\n\\left(h,f^{-1}[U],\\{O\\cap f^{-1}[U]:O\\in\\tau_X\\},\nU\\times F,\\tau_{U\\times F}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in f^{-1}[U]\\;(\\pi_1(h(x))=f(x))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\\exists F_\\alpha\\subseteq F\\;\n\\bigl(h[S_\\alpha\\cap f^{-1}[U]]=U\\times F_\\alpha\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{StratifiedLocallyTrivial}_S(f,\\mathcal S,I,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_Y\\;\\exists F,\\tau_F,\\tau_{U\\times F},h\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\ny\\in U\n\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(F,\\tau_F)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\tau_{U\\times F}\n=\\{W\\subseteq U\\times F:\\forall\\langle u,z\\rangle\\in W\\;\n\\exists O\\in\\tau_Y\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_F\\;\n(u\\in O\\cap U\\land z\\in V\\land(O\\cap U)\\times V\\subseteq W)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\n\\left(h,f^{-1}[U],\\{O\\cap f^{-1}[U]:O\\in\\tau_X\\},\nU\\times F,\\tau_{U\\times F}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in f^{-1}[U]\\;(\\pi_1(h(x))=f(x))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\\exists F_\\alpha\\subseteq F\\;\n\\bigl(h[S_\\alpha\\cap f^{-1}[U]]=U\\times F_\\alpha\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}thom}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WhitneyStratification}_S(\\mathcal S,I,X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldData}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_Y,m)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop4ProperMap}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,I,\\omega_{&gt;0})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal A_\\bullet,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal A_\\bullet))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{StratumSubmersionData}_S\n\\left(f,S_\\alpha,\\{O\\cap S_\\alpha:O\\in\\tau_X\\},\n\\mathcal A_\\bullet(\\alpha),d(\\alpha),Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_Y,m\\right)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{StratifiedLocallyTrivial}_S\n(f,\\mathcal S,I,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}thom}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WhitneyStratification}_S(\\mathcal S,I,X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldData}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_Y,m)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop4ProperMap}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,I,\\omega_{&gt;0})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal A_\\bullet,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal A_\\bullet))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{StratumSubmersionData}_S\n\\left(f,S_\\alpha,\\{O\\cap S_\\alpha:O\\in\\tau_X\\},\n\\mathcal A_\\bullet(\\alpha),d(\\alpha),Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_Y,m\\right)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{StratifiedLocallyTrivial}_S\n(f,\\mathcal S,I,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Whitney stratification receives its exact index, carrier, and topology arguments. Target and stratum atlases, dimensions, tangent maps, and the topology of the local product trivialization are all explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top4-proper-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ffb0a0f4e68507b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top4-proper-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-stratification.md","status":"resolved","id":"c86c862e709fb95d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-stratification.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md","status":"resolved","id":"d530952583f9f96d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-atlas.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved